<title>ITALY: Italcementi reports higher 1996 operating.</title>
<headline>Italcementi reports higher 1996 operating.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year months ending Dec 31 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated, not yet certified by auditors)</p>
<p>    Cons turnover    six percent lower at 5.14 trillion lire</p>
<p>    Parent co turnover	    1.065 trillion vs similar</p>
<p>    Parent co gross operating margin    187.00 vs 143.00</p>
<p>    Parent co operating profit	 around 62 vs 52</p>
<p>    Total staff			around 16,000 vs around 15,300</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129450</p>
</text>
